{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t新華社報道，解放軍海軍組織遼寧艦航母編隊，到西太平洋相關海域開展訓練。這是根據年度計劃組織的例行性訓練，目標是檢驗提升部隊實戰化訓練水平，不斷提高履行使命能力，符合相關國際法和國際實踐，不針對特定國家和目標。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.858087+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T04:53:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:18:12.825391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:19.362523+00:00","content_hash":"6a36d773d382800eb998eab67f4143d88d2ba50f3359ad0459cf9e4c46fb8c8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}